{"4915180": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "EXORCISMUS: Vade Retro Satana", "steam_appid": 4915180, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4915220], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You Are Never Alone.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXORCISMUS: Vade Retro Satana</strong> is a psychological exorcism horror featuring the unique <strong>Presence System</strong> and a <strong>3D Jumpscare</strong> effect. Every sound has a source. The demon sees you, hears you, and senses your fear, reacting to your actions in real time. Forget predictable jumpscares.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PRESENCE SYSTEM</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every sound has a source.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you hear a bottle shatter...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >it's because the demon actually threw it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you hear footsteps...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >someone is walking through the apartment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you find a message written on the wall...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the demon has just written it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world reveals its presence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whispers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anomalies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Knocking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Doors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You never know what will happen next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4915180/extras/f2848dfe31d75546644338cd7287c975.poster.avif?t=1786305543\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4915180/extras/f2848dfe31d75546644338cd7287c975.webm?t=1786305543\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4915180/extras/f2848dfe31d75546644338cd7287c975.mp4?t=1786305543\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE DEMON FIGHTS BACK</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demon watches your every move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It hears every sound you make.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It remembers your actions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It reacts to the progress of the ritual.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It becomes more aggressive over time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It can turn off the lights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It can throw objects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It can reveal itself for only a second.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It can watch you from the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It can write messages on the walls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It can strike when you least expect it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn't a series of scripted animations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demon decides when to scare you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4915180/extras/cbb9128100e6928e383f10a79dba3301.poster.avif?t=1786305543\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4915180/extras/cbb9128100e6928e383f10a79dba3301.webm?t=1786305543\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4915180/extras/cbb9128100e6928e383f10a79dba3301.mp4?t=1786305543\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A REAL EXORCISM RITUAL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the role of a priest's assistant and participate in a terrifying exorcism ritual.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Document the entire ritual using a voice recorder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assist the priest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place candles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recite prayers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete ritual-related tasks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Witness the growing signs of possession.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the final confrontation, use the cross, holy water, and prayers to face the demon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4915180/extras/9572d771976f6ec2c7e90d5445052b51.avif?t=1786305543\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4915180/extras_big/9572d771976f6ec2c7e90d5445052b51.avif?t=1786305543 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >POSSESSION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout the ritual, you watch over the possessed victim.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The closer you get to the end...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the more the victim changes...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and so does the apartment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The line between reality and hell slowly begins to disappear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4915180/extras/a9879e847d6d09bb68f6b883749f3172.poster.avif?t=1786305543\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4915180/extras/a9879e847d6d09bb68f6b883749f3172.webm?t=1786305543\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4915180/extras/a9879e847d6d09bb68f6b883749f3172.mp4?t=1786305543\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >3D JUMPSCARE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A special 3D Jumpscare effect makes demons appear as if they are literally bursting out of your monitor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No VR headset.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No glasses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just you...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and the demon on the other side of the screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4915180/extras/5aa80bb1a36b8aae03c6c2d12ea39ca9.poster.avif?t=1786305543\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4915180/extras/5aa80bb1a36b8aae03c6c2d12ea39ca9.webm?t=1786305543\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4915180/extras/5aa80bb1a36b8aae03c6c2d12ea39ca9.mp4?t=1786305543\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Presence System that reacts to the player in real time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every sound is the result of the demon physically interacting with the environment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unpredictable paranormal manifestations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3D Jumpscare effect without VR or special glasses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Document the exorcism using a voice recorder.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perform realistic tasks inspired by real exorcism rituals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight the demon using a crucifix, holy water, and prayers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Possession evolves as the ritual progresses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dark Eastern European apartment inspired by late 80s and 90s architecture.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full Gamepad Support.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Achievements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Cloud.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Graphics Settings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Windows, Linux and macOS support.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >175 language localizations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voice Over for selected languages.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_g